      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MARLI MOO (7) was strongly fancied last time on the back of some superb recent form, including a two-run winning streak, but could only manage third (44.37) at this track. Safe beginner but wide box to overcome and will need some luck. Winning claims. OREGON JANET (3) goes very well this trip starting 26 times for nine wins and nine minors. Below best last time at this track (43.90) in a Special conditions race, finishing a 14 length sixth. Looks a key chance on best figures. AKELA MARTIAL (5) finds it hard to win. Better run when finding the frame last time though, finishing third (38.11) at Gawler. Solid record at the distance winning four races. Solid beginner who can clear the tricky draw. Bold showing expected. NITRO NEO (1) can run a bold race on best form.",
